# Baked DEM tiles: 4,178 PNGs, 402.6 MB, reproducible with `npm run bake:dem`
# in about a minute. Far too big for the repo, and they are a pure function of
# the bake script plus the bbox in the manifest. The manifest itself IS tracked
# (see the negation below) so the tile list and zoom levels stay under review.
public/dem/**/*.png
!public/dem/manifest.json
